---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import site from '../data/site.json';
import { topics } from '../lib/topics';
const fallbackTopics = topics.filter((t) => ['fishing', 'kayaks', 'homelab'].includes(t.id));
---
<Base title="About" description="Main quest: life. Side quests: kayak fishing, homelab projects and whatever comes next.">
  <div class="wrap page prose">
    <div class="eyebrow">About</div>
    <h1>Main Quest: Life<br /><span class="hero-side">Side Quest: Everything Else</span></h1>
    <!-- About copy approved by Dan Oct 27, 2026 (drafted by Hoshi). Photo placeholder: src/assets/about.jpg still to come. -->
    <p>I'm Dan. My main quest is simple: live life to the fullest. The trouble is, I get distracted. A lot.</p>
    <p>One day it's a sunrise kayak launch on a quiet creek, the next it's chasing bass along a brushy shoreline at Canyon Lake, and somewhere in between I'm rebuilding a server in my homelab at midnight. Every new hobby turns into a side quest, and every side quest turns into a story.</p>
    <p>Distracted Quest is where I share those stories. You'll find kayak fishing trips (the catches and the ones that got away), the occasional snag or lost lure, homelab projects, and whatever new rabbit hole I fall down next. I'm not a pro at any of it. I'm just someone who'd rather try something new than sit still.</p>
    <p>If you like the outdoors, tinkering, or getting a little sidetracked, you're in the right place. Grab your gear and come along. The main quest can wait.</p>
    <h2>What you'll find here</h2>
    <ul>
      {fallbackTopics.map((t) => <li><a href={`/videos?topic=${t.id}`}><strong>{t.label}</strong></a>: {t.blurb}</li>)}
      <li><strong>Other side quests</strong>: firearms, BBQ, gaming, pipes &amp; cigars, autonomous technologies, space and everything in between.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>How DQ Is Made</h2>
    <!-- Approved by Dan Nov 15, 2026 exactly as written. -->
    <p>Everything you see on Distracted Quest is real. Every cast, every catch, every missed hookset, every kayak launch, and every homelab build is real footage and real photos that I shot myself.</p>
    <p>Behind the scenes, I get help from a team of AI assistants built with Grok Bot. They help me review and organize my footage, make edits, and post to the channels, so I can spend more time on the water and less time at a desk.</p>
    <p>The only AI-generated content is the channel intro animation. Everything else is captured by me, on my own trips.</p>
    <p>Curious how it works? You can try Grok Bot with my referral link: <a href="https://grok.com/refer/bot?code=WKYWX9PCWAME" rel="sponsored noopener" target="_blank">Try Grok Bot</a>. (Referral link: I may receive credit if you sign up. It costs you nothing.)</p>
    <h2>Follow along</h2>
    <p>{site.socials.map((s, i) => <>{i > 0 && ' · '}<a href={s.url} rel="me noopener" target="_blank">{s.label}</a></>)}</p>
  </div>
</Base>
